### Portfolio 4.1-4.3 through the gateway (login first: EdgeGateway.Api.http; UserId = the token's "sub")
@Gateway = http://localhost:5000
@UserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@Token = paste-the-access-token

### what may be chosen: risk ceiling, investable share, names for the screen
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/options
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4.1 published allocation (institutionStyle: YAPIKREDI | ISBANK | ZIRAAT)
PUT {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "option": "INSTITUTION", "riskLevel": "MEDIUM", "institutionStyle": "ISBANK" }

### 4.2 own choice
PUT {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "option": "CUSTOM", "riskLevel": "MEDIUM", "focusAssets": ["GOLD", "NVDA"], "excludedAssets": ["BTC"] }

### 4.3 standard basket without an asset
PUT {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "option": "STANDARD", "riskLevel": "LOW", "excludedAssets": ["BTC"] }

### calculate the proposal from the saved choice
POST {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/proposal
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### last proposal (stale=true when the IQ changed after it)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/{{UserId}}/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4.4 paper account
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/market/account
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4.4 ledger (status = OPEN or CLOSED; without it both)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/market/trades?asset=BTC&status=CLOSED
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4.4 one trade: events, every confirmation, trader and standard story
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/market/trades/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 4.4 statistics
GET {{Gateway}}/api/portfolio/market/performance
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
